Third-party components
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Termcast bundles or downloads the following programs at build time. They are
separate works, distributed under their own licenses, and are not covered by
the AGPL grant above. The build scripts under scripts/ fetch them from their
upstream sources; none of their source is vendored in this repository.

  ttyd            MIT License        https://github.com/tsl0922/ttyd
  tmux            ISC License        https://github.com/tmux/tmux
  libwebsockets   MIT License        https://github.com/warmcat/libwebsockets
  utf8proc        MIT License        https://github.com/JuliaStrings/utf8proc
  ncurses         X11-style License  https://invisible-island.net/ncurses/

Node.js dependencies are declared in relay-server/package.json and
relay-desktop/package.json; their licenses are recorded in the corresponding
package-lock.json files and in each package's own distribution.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Protocol test vectors
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

protocol-vectors/v1.json embeds the X25519 key pairs published in RFC 7748
section 6.1. Those values are public test vectors from the IETF specification
and carry no confidentiality expectation. They are test data only and are
never used as production keys.
